WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.700
Excuse me.

2
00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:04.400
May I ask you something?

3
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:07.900
Does your phone battery last three days?

4
00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:08.600
Well, no.

5
00:00:10.100 --> 00:00:12.200
Do you have a couple of minutes for me to steal you for a bit?

6
00:00:17.300 --> 00:00:18.000
I am Luka.

7
00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:20.400
How long have you been working in the kitchen?

8
00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:22.100
The fourth year.

9
00:00:22.100 --> 00:00:23.100
Is there a lot of work?

10
00:00:23.300 --> 00:00:25.300
There is as much work as you like.

11
00:00:25.400 --> 00:00:26.800
Now I have a surprise for you.

12
00:00:27.100 --> 00:00:28.100
Okay?

13
00:00:28.680 --> 00:00:35.680
Since you said your battery does not last three days, we have prepared a new phone for you, the Redmi Note 17.

14
00:00:35.680 --> 00:00:40.680
Its battery lasts up to three days, and it is resistant to both knocks and dust.

15
00:00:40.680 --> 00:00:44.680
They praised you, saying that you are hard-working and diligent.

16
00:00:45.680 --> 00:00:48.680
Ooooh, how nicely it is wrapped.

17
00:00:48.680 --> 00:00:49.680
Crazy!

18
00:00:52.680 --> 00:00:53.680
It is gorgeous.

19
00:00:53.680 --> 00:00:55.680
I did not expect a phone.

20
00:00:57.260 --> 00:00:58.840
No, it is nothing, thank you so much, Luka.
